<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Text Formatting</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Tags for different formats</h1>
    <h2>Bold</h2>
    <p>My name is <b>Marut Shrivastav</b></p>
    <h2>Italic</h2>
    <p>I am learning <i>Web Dev</i></p>
    <h2>Underlined</h2>
    <p>This page is for <u>formatting tags</u></p>
    <h2>Strikethrough</h2>
    <p>My name is <s>Prashant Singh</s> <b>Marut Shrivastav</b></p>
    <h2>Superscript</h2>
    <p>No. of outputs in decoder is equal to 2<sup>n</sup>, where n is no. of inputs</p>
    <h2>Subscript</h2>
    <p>Chemical formula of water is H<sub>2</sub>O</p>
</body>
</html>
